<h2 id="onlyref-folders" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">2. Plan folder lifecycle</h2>

| Subfolder | When the plan belongs there |
|-----------|------------------------------|
| **`cursor_gen/refactor_plans/new/`** | **`onlyref`** authored or refreshed; **every** implementable phased item is **`[ ]`**. |
| **`cursor_gen/refactor_plans/wip/`** | **`implref`** / **`resumimpl`** marked **≥1** implementable **`[X]`**, but not all implementable work is done. |
| **`cursor_gen/refactor_plans/completed/`** | All implementable phased items are **`[X]`** (or waived per **implref** step 3.5). |

**`onlyref` MUST:** create or update plans only at **`cursor_gen/refactor_plans/new/REFACTOR_<SHORT_TOPIC>.md`**. **Do not** **`git mv`** out of **`new/`** — relocation is **`implref`** only (follow **implref** step 3.5; do not duplicate the table there).

