<h2 id="onlyref-self" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">6. Self-check (agent)</h2>

- [ ] User invocation included **`onlyref`** (or synonymous explicit "plan-only, don't implement").
- [ ] Produced plan matches **numbered phases + `[ ]` checklists + Quality bar** and MRKD outline.
- [ ] Plan path is **`cursor_gen/refactor_plans/new/REFACTOR_*.md`** (not **`wip/`** / **`completed/`**).
- [ ] Closing reply names **exact plan path** and says **implement with `implref`**, not silently coding.
- [ ] No **`git commit`** pretending phases shipped; no **`git mv`** out of **`new/`** under **`onlyref`**.
